  "tut1_title": "Welcome to the Gate of Haewon!",
  "tut1_content": "This is the Gate between the living and the dead.\nBecome a Master, purify the resentful spirits,\nand guide their souls to ascension!",
  "tut2_title": "Place Towers",
  "tut2_content": "Long press a tower icon at the bottom,\nthen drag it onto a green placement slot.\n\nTowers cost Spirit(⚡) to build.\nGood placement gives you a strategic advantage!",
  "tut3_title": "Tower Elements (Five Elements)",
  "tut3_content": "🔥 Fire Beacon — AoE attack\n💧 Water Spring — Slow/Debuff\n🌿 Wood Shrine — Multi-hit\n⚔️ Metal Bell — Heavy single hit\n🪨 Earth Altar — Summon soldiers\n\nElement synergy is the key to strategy!",
  "tut4_title": "Day & Night Cycle",
  "tut4_content": "☀️ During day, Fire & Wood towers are stronger.\n🌙 At night, Water & Metal towers are stronger\n  and stealth enemies appear.\n⏳ During transitions, Earth towers are boosted.\n\nPlace towers according to time of day!",
  "tut5_title": "Soul Purification System",
  "tut5_content": "Defeating enemies drops spirit orbs\nthat auto-purify for Spirit resources!\n\n⚠️ If purification falls behind, the \"Wailing\"\ngauge rises, weakening towers. At 100%,\nall enemies go berserk!",
  "tut6_title": "Hero Combat",
  "tut6_content": "Heroes auto-attack enemies in range\nand skills activate when off cooldown.\n\n💡 Tap a hero to trigger skill instantly!\nDrag to reposition them.\n\nReady? Let the battle begin!",
